Input data for Contrails

25000.d0                           ! Ambient pressure [Pa]
220.d0                              ! Ambient temperature [K]
1.d0                                 ! Ambient Saturation ratio w.r.t ice [-]
0.5                               ! Jet radius [m]
400                               ! Jet initial velocity [m/s]
600                              ! Jet initial temperature [K]
1.64                                 ! Mixing line slope parameter G [Pa/K]

12.5                                  ! Geometric mean radius of Soot particles [nm]
1.6                                 ! Standard deviation of Soot particles
15                                  ! Geometric mean radius of Ambient aerosols [nm]
2.2                                 ! Standard deviation of Ambient aerosols
6.d8                                ! ambient number conc  [orig - 6.d8]                                  



